<div class="info">
  <div class="header">MOBILE HOTSPOT DATA USAGE</div>
  <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="leftcontent">
          <p>Flashing, graphing data, and viewing data display are the<br>most bandwidth-intensive activities on wiTECH 2.0. Flash<br>file size varies between different ECUs.</p>

          <div class="card">
              <font color="#0066cc">EXAMPLE:</font> When using the graphing function, if the technician goes on an hour road test per week, they can expect to use 64 MB of data per month. Most diagnostic functions will use substantially less data than this scenario.
          </div>

          <p>Once the flash has been downloaded to the microPod the<br> first time, it will stay cached on the mircroPod, allowing for<br>the same flash to be used on different vehicles without<br>having to download the flash again.</p>

      </div>

      <div class="righttable">
          <table class="table-fill">
              <thead>
                  <tr>
                      <th class="text-left">wiTECH 2.0 OPERATION</th>
